      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>There is apartment-style housing available on campus at Auburn University at Montgomery. Warhawk Hall is a residence hall that offers a vibrant atmosphere with shared common spaces and a range of room configurations. The University Commons Apartments offer a more independent living experience, with fully furnished units with private bedrooms and communal living areas. The recently constructed North Commons Apartments provide spacious, contemporary accommodations equipped with modern amenities. Each residence is equipped with high-speed internet, laundry facilities, and 24-hour security measures to ensure a safe and secure living experience.</p>",
